'''Li'l Zyclone''' (ミニアンデッドサイクロン, ''Mini Andeddo Saikuron'', '''Mini Undead Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[Zyclone]] that appears in the [[Zombie Outbreaks]] of [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3 and [[Cats of the Cosmos]], as well as [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

