==Trivia==
*His 333,333 HP and 333 damage may be a reference to how in Cantonese, the pronunciation of the number three (三, pronounced "saam") is similar to words like "life" or "birth" (生, pronounced "saang"), which is in line with his favorite subjects outside of [[BCEN]] being health/physical ed and resuscitation.
*He has the lowest attack power and overall DPS of all [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s.
*He and [[Zyclone]] are the only Cyclones to have a moving eye, as well as the only Cyclones who do not blink.

